    "Median latency is identical in all operations (tab select, folder toggle, palette open/type/close; vsync-quantized). An earlier apparent one-frame palette-open gap was vsync-phase alignment: splitting the open path shows equal totals. Rust/Metal palette-open p95 is one frame higher (41.5 vs 33.2 ms).",
